- layout.tsx already references /og-default.png for openGraph.images and
  twitter.images with metadataBase(NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL) providing the
  absolute URL resolution — no metadata code changes required.
- Adds the missing 1200x630 social preview asset (dark premium SaaS /
  luxury-tech style, champagne gold accents, CreatorOS branding) so link
  unfurls on X, LinkedIn, Discord, Slack and WhatsApp render correctly
  instead of showing a broken image.
